=== UI FEATURES

On desktop: navigation by side menu
[DASHBOARD] - Overview screen (with customizable widgets for things like "Budget Health", "Bucket Status", "Account Balances", "Recent Transactions", "Graphs" etc.)
[CREATE NEW TRANSACTION] - Create a new transaction (only INC, EXP, TRF, INP are possible here, rest are system created)
[BUCKETS] - See the status of all your buckets right now (CAF, TF), click to see transactions
[BUCKET SETUP] - Create and manage your budget buckets
    - Create buckets
    - Edit buckets (change name, importance, priority status)
    - Adjust buckets
        - Temporary: set TF to your desired value including above BC (creates BUA transaction)
        - Future: set RA (and BC based on rules or if below new RA when using fixed), leaving TF the same
        - Both: set RA (and BC based on rules or if below new RA when using fixed), TF adjusted by the relative increase/decrease (creates BUA transaction)
        - You may also select the option to reallocate between buckets with the same three options, if TF is adjusted,
    - Delete buckets
[BUDGET SETUP] - Management screen, looks at all your buckets. Used to setup a budget, enter expected income on each source account every month then set refill amount for each bucket, the system will show % allocated and remaining from the expected income.
[ACCOUNTS] - See the status of your accounts, click to see transactions
    - You may also adjust account balance from here, creating a BLA transaction for the difference
[ACCOUNT SETUP] - Create and manage your bank accounts
[TRANSACTIONS] - Manage transactions (filter by bank account, bucket, cycle etc.), including corrections and reversals
[SAVINGS] - Look at money expected to be deposited to various savings targets. Click "Done" to automatically create the transactions to move the money to the savings targets
[SAVINGS SETUP] - Setup savings targets and the Priority rules used by the savings distribution
[STATS AND REPORTS] - See graphs seeing your spending, account balances over time. Generate report PDFs of your spending over the last year. Options to filter by bucket, tags on the transactions, company/person etc.
[SETTINGS AND MORE]
    - User account management (password, preferences)
    - Data export and import (export transactions, bucket setups etc.)
[ADMIN] - Admin screens
    - User management (incl. reset of passwords)

On mobile; navigation by bottom tabs/use a more simplified set of options with sub-menus instead of listing every option
